{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18077","headline":"读皇甫湜公安园池诗书其後二首 一 · 韩愈","name":"读皇甫湜公安园池诗书其後二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晋人目二子，其犹吹一吷。\n区区自其下，顾肯挂牙舌。\n春秋书王法，不诛其人身。\n尔雅注虫鱼，定非磊落人。\n湜也困公安，不自闲穷年。\n枉智思掎摭，粪壤污秽岂有臧。\n诚不如两忘，但以一概量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}